cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MindBench, please cite it as below."
title: "MindBench: a preregistered online experiment battery for attention, perception and memory"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Patel
    given-names: Bharg
repository-code: https://github.com/Bhargp08/MindBench
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A preregistered self-experiment testing whether naturally varying sleep and time of day change
  working-memory, free-recall, attention and perception performance. Code is MIT-licensed;
  released data will be CC-BY-4.0.
keywords:
  - preregistration
  - sleep
  - working memory
  - drift-diffusion model
  - open data
